{"id":"torrey:hair-the","source":"torrey","name":"Hair, The","slug":"hair-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The natural covering of the head — Ps 68:21.","refs":[["Ps",68,21,68,21]]},{"text":"Innumerable — Ps 40:12; 69:4.","refs":[["Ps",40,12,40,12],["Ps",69,4,69,4]]},{"text":"Growth of — Jdj 16:22.","refs":[["Judg",16,22,16,22]]},{"text":"Numbers. — Mt 10:30.","refs":[["Matt",10,30,10,30]]},{"text":"Takes care of. — Da 3:27; Lu 21:18.","refs":[["Dan",3,27,3,27],["Luke",21,18,21,18]]},{"text":"Black, particularly esteemed — Song 5:11.","refs":[["Song",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"A token of age. — 1Sa 12:2; Ps 71:18.","refs":[["1Sam",12,2,12,2],["Ps",71,18,71,18]]},{"text":"A token of weakness and decay. — Ho 7:9.","refs":[["Hos",7,9,7,9]]},{"text":"An emblem of wisdom. — Da 7:9; Job 12:12.","refs":[["Dan",7,9,7,9],["Job",12,12,12,12]]},{"text":"With righteousness, a crown of glory. — Pr 16:31.","refs":[["Prov",16,31,16,31]]},{"text":"To be reverenced. — Le 19:32.","refs":[["Lev",19,32,19,32]]},{"text":"Man cannot even change the colour or — Mt 5:36.","refs":[["Matt",5,36,5,36]]},{"text":"Worn long for a covering. — 1Co 11:15.","refs":[["1Cor",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"Plaited and broidered. — 1Ti 2:9; 1Pe 3:3.","refs":[["1Tim",2,9,2,9],["1Pet",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Well set and ornamented. — Isa 3:24.","refs":[["Isa",3,24,3,24]]},{"text":"Neglected in grief. — Lu 7:38; Joh 12:3.","refs":[["Luke",7,38,7,38],["John",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"Sometimes worn long by men — 2Sa 14:26.","refs":[["2Sam",14,26,14,26]]},{"text":"Men condemned for wearing long — 1Co 11:14.","refs":[["1Cor",11,14,11,14]]},{"text":"Often expensively anointed — Ec 9:8.","refs":[["Eccl",9,8,9,8]]},{"text":"Not to be cut or shorn during their vow. — Nu 6:5; Jdj 16:17,19,20.","refs":[["Num",6,5,6,5],["Judg",16,17,16,17],["Judg",16,19,16,19],["Judg",16,20,16,20]]},{"text":"Shorn after completion of vow. — Nu 6:18.","refs":[["Num",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"Of the healed leper to be shorn — Le 14:9.","refs":[["Lev",